Num 16:1 , The rebellion of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram;
Num 16:23 , Moses separates the people from the rebels' tents;
Num 16:31 , The earth swallows up Korah, and a fire consumes others;
Num 16:36 , The censers are reserved to holy use;
Num 16:41 , Fourteen thousand and seven hundred are slain by a plague, for murmuring against Moses and Aaron;
Num 16:46 , Aaron by incense stays the plague.
